<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Bratislava Guide: 10 places – UFO deck, old town, castle, Blue Church &amp; Devín – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/bratislava/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>2. Bratislava Castle</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Go up in the late afternoon and stay until sunset. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/bratislava/#o2</description><Point><coordinates>17.10047,48.14259,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>3. Old town &amp; Čumil</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Find all the figures and take a photo with Čumil. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/bratislava/#o3</description><Point><coordinates>17.10886,48.14284,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>4. Michael’s Gate &amp; Main Square</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Climb the tower and then go to the Main Square. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/bratislava/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>17.10674,48.14517,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. St Martin’s Cathedral</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Look at the golden crown on the tower. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/bratislava/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>17.10488,48.14198,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>6. Blue Church (Church of St Elizabeth)</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Come in the morning and check the opening times. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/bratislava/#o6</description><Point><coordinates>17.11674,48.14336,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>8. Slavín – memorial with a view</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Go up at sunset. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/bratislava/#o8</description><Point><coordinates>17.09959,48.1539,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. Devín Castle ruins</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Take the bus and plan half a day. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/bratislava/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>16.98037,48.17311,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
